---

<figure class="window" aria-label="The window usemcpkit opens when a tool needs access">
  <div class="titlebar" aria-hidden="true">
    <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    <em>usemcpkit · Connect</em>
  </div>
  <div class="body" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="head">
      <span class="mark">›_</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Connect Cloudflare</h3>
        <p>A tool call needs access to Cloudflare. What you enter is saved on this computer and used for later calls.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="legend">Credential</p>
    <div class="methods">
      <span>Sign in with OAuth2</span>
      <span class="selected">API token</span>
    </div>
    <p class="label">Access token</p>
    <div class="input"><span>••••••••••••••••</span></div>
    <p class="note">Saved on this computer only.</p>
    <div class="buttons">
      <span class="ghost">Cancel</span>
      <span class="primary">Save and continue →</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>The first call that needs access opens this window. Nothing is asked up front.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .window {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 0;
    user-select: none;
    -webkit-user-select: none;
  }

  .titlebar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 0;
    border-radius: 14px 14px 0 0;
    background: var(--surface-raised);
  }

  .titlebar span {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--border-strong);
  }

  .titlebar em {
    margin-left: 8px;
    color: var(--quiet);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .body {
    padding: 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0 0 14px 14px;
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .head {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .mark {
    display: grid;
    flex: none;
    place-items: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border: 1px solid #474068;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #24223a;
    color: #c4b8ff;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .head p {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .legend,
  .label {
    margin: 20px 0 6px;
    color: #dfe0ed;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .label {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .methods {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1px;
    padding: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--border-strong);
  }

  .methods span {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 38px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: var(--surface-raised);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .methods .selected {
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--accent);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .input {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #12131a;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    cursor: text;
  }

  .note {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    color: var(--quiet);
    font-size: 11.5px;
  }

  .buttons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .buttons span {
    padding: 9px 16px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ghost {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .primary {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-ink);
  }

  figcaption {
    user-select: text;
    -webkit-user-select: text;
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: var(--quiet);
    font-size: 13px;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
